    affiliation: "Instituto de Ciências Biológicas (ICB), Universidade Federal de Minas Gerais (UFMG)"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/<ORCID_ID>"
keywords:
  - multiscale modeling
  - proteostasis
  - hormesis
  - SERPINA1
  - alpha-1 antitrypsin deficiency
  - competing risks
  - Fine-Gray
  - agent-based modeling
  - transcriptomics
